    <!-- Scientific Disclaimer -->
    <string name="disclaimer_phone_limitation">Smartphones cannot reliably identify gold, silver, or copper using the built-in magnetometer alone. The built-in sensor measures geomagnetic field changes and primarily detects ferromagnetic materials and magnetic anomalies. Accurate non-ferrous discrimination requires a dedicated external metal detection coil sensor.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_not_guaranteed">All target classifications are mathematical estimates based on signal anomalies and are never scientifically guaranteed.</string>
    <string name="no_magnetometer_error">This device lacks an internal magnetometer (hardware compass). You can connect an external BLE/USB detector or enable Developer Test Mode.</string>
